WEBVTT

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.360
Lost in the direction of a vast road ahead

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:27.400
Want to escape the cycle, be myself for once

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.500
Crashing into a chaotic world

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.790
Ever since I met you, my course has changed

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:41.040
Define the world as infinity

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.560
No need to be suspicious

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:45.260
No need to doubt

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:49.600
You're light, I'm darkness, in mutual opposition

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.880
Like the opposite ends of magnets

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.840
In natural tacit agreement

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:57.580
Quarrel gets reconciled in split seconds

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:02.520
Can't see and can't hear in subtlety

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:07.820
You know what I'm thinking

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.080
Your trust is burning

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:17.160
is my smiling response to the world

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.460
Relying on each other

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.060
Vast potential to rewrite life

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:23.960
May be unexpected

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:25.920
In every circumstance

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:33.600
To face all battles together

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.500
Let the chains that bound us together

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:40.440
Converge into an unlimited, exciting

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:45.620
Splendor

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:49.540
Soul Contract

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:54.300
Eighth Contract

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:59.260
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:12.580
You're a trash when Yangming Master isn't around

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:16.710
I could single-handedly toy you till you're done for

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.210
Such a weakling

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:21.100
I don't get what Duanmu sees in you

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:21.700
Hey

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:22.940
How is it?

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:25.650
Will you call your master over to save you?

00:02:25.652 --> 00:02:27.149
"Young Master Xi"

00:02:27.149 --> 00:02:29.309
"Save me quick!"

00:02:29.309 --> 00:02:31.808
"I'm going to perish"

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.620
I don't give a hoot about him

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.300
Are you in a damn small theatrical performance?

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.150
Still defiant?

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:42.320
Looks like I haven't stabbed deep enough yet

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:45.900
I'll keep on tormenting you till you say his birth date

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:46.810
You're mad

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:48.700
How dare you

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:58.460
I'm the only one who can touch him

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:02.040
I never expect he'd give you a self-defense tool

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:05.120
but what can you do with your crappy kung-fu?

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:08.630
This kind of trick is useless against a Spirit Manipulator

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:27.980
Do you know how much years of effort it took for me to beat him?

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:31.718
Can you not drag me into your obsession towards him?

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:32.870
I've said it before

00:03:32.872 --> 00:03:33.875
If he dies

00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:35.137
I'm over

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.200
How pesky

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:41.520
Looks like I'll have to do it the hard way or else you won't surrender

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.270
W-What are you doing?

00:03:43.272 --> 00:03:45.208
If you still won't say

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.360
I'll stab this dagger into your heart

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:49.640
I'll speak

00:03:49.864 --> 00:03:51.114
Understood now?

00:03:51.426 --> 00:03:53.992
I say, have you eaten sh*t?

00:03:53.992 --> 00:03:55.099
Your mouth stinks

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:57.520
- You're so close, you suffocate me
- Bastard!

00:03:57.520 --> 00:03:59.000
I'll kill you!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.080
Hmph! How many times I gotta tell you?

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.680
I'm dead already

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.300
Idiot

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.830
You know what extinguishing spirit means?

00:04:10.839 --> 00:04:13.887
Spirits can still linger in this world after they died

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:15.480
but if a spirit is snuffed out

00:04:15.482 --> 00:04:16.716
the soul disappears

00:04:16.716 --> 00:04:18.091
and unable to reincarnate

00:04:18.091 --> 00:04:22.095
In other words, you'll absolutely cease to exist

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:26.060
Consider this as a small revenge against Duanmu Xi

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:27.430
My soul

00:04:27.638 --> 00:04:29.405
is disappearing

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:32.570
Duanmu Xi

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:46.040
Who?

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.740
Duanmu Xi isn't far from here

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:52.610
Use your telepathy to call him

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.189
Shout out to him

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:58.000
It would be such a pity once this faithful dog is dead

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.290
Shout now!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.280
Call for help?

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.430
No

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.660
I won't do it not matter what

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.100
I don't want to lose

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.580
I don't want to be ridiculed

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.180
Don't want to be a weakling

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:12.580
Don't even want to constantly stay behind him

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.930
and get protected by him

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:15.870
I had enough of this

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.670
I want power

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.330
I want to become stronger

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.060
I want this weapon

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:45.600
What?

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:49.260
A Soul Image like you manage to pick up the Luoye Blade?

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:50.320
Who are you?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.320
Power

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.820
I need more power!

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:06.580
S-Stop!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.260
In order to become stronger

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.190
Kill!

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:17.240
What

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.200
was that just now?

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.480
You deserve to die!

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:22.780
I saw it

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:24.640
I finally saw it

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:26.390
You're actually an evil spirit

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:28.880
I should've finished you off

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:31.480
To forestall all evil

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.590
Duanmu Xi

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:46.580
Situ Li

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.420
How dare you

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:49.620
Duanmu Xi

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.520
Your wound has nothing to do with me

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:52.800
You invited it yourself

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:55.980
Although I haven't officially announced it at the ceremony

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:58.120
but after signing the Soul Contract,

00:06:58.120 --> 00:06:59.740
he's considered my spirit

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:00.640
No one

00:07:00.645 --> 00:07:03.629
is allowed to touch him

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:08.000
Sometimes I really admire you

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.260
You can act so cool somehow

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:11.960
but then again

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:14.958
I want to eradicate you even more

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:21.280
Fool

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.100
Enough playing tricks

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:24.590
You should reflect more on

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.680
how to be a filial son

00:07:26.863 --> 00:07:30.020
Don't you speak about that coward old fool

00:07:30.036 --> 00:07:31.540
Why must the Situ family

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:34.460
be a slave to others?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.220
Young Master Xi

00:07:38.172 --> 00:07:39.030
Oh no!

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:40.440
This is bad!

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:42.900
Young Master Xi is wounded!

00:07:46.999 --> 00:07:48.593
I understand the situation

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:49.840
You may leave

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.620
Keep your mouth shut

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:52.860
and don't tell anyone

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.080
Most of all, don't let the old lady knows

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.100
Yes, Ma'am

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:57.920
This home

00:07:57.921 --> 00:08:00.141
is never going to be peaceful

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.260
My poor little Xi

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:04.780
is injured so badly

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:07.640
A hole in the palm

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:08.850
Where's Situ Li

00:08:08.859 --> 00:08:10.344
Is he insane or stupid?

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:12.520
How could he do this to a Yangming Master?

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:13.480
I'm so sorry

00:08:13.485 --> 00:08:15.249
I didn't bring up my son properly

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.800
I've already grounded him

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.520
Took away his mobile and WIFI

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:20.160
until he realizes his mistake

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:20.800
Hmph!

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.120
Very good

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:27.220
Don't ever assume you guys can step on us just because the Situ family is our distant relative

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:28.180
Enough

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:31.220
There're some things you aren't supposed to say

00:08:31.259 --> 00:08:33.260
I have a different view on this

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.900
The cause of this incident

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.520
was due to Soul Image himself

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.710
who used Duanmu family's sacred weapon

00:08:38.715 --> 00:08:40.576
and caused Situ Li serious injury

00:08:40.576 --> 00:08:42.964
Thus, provoking him to over react

00:08:42.964 --> 00:08:45.243
Therefore, in Mr. Yang's case,

00:08:45.243 --> 00:08:47.259
he's the one responsible

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:48.245
Hey!

00:08:48.245 --> 00:08:49.747
Are you kidding me?

00:08:49.747 --> 00:08:51.464
Situ Li was actually the one

00:08:51.464 --> 00:08:52.477
injuring Duanmu Xi

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.780
Why put the blame on Yang Jinghua?

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:57.220
Mr. Yang is still a stranger to us

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.200
He's gotten some criticisms lately

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.110
He caused such a great problem now

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:03.940
Great grandma won't be able to protect him

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:05.520
What's so good about Situ Li?

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.600
Why do you speak for him?

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:09.500
The Situs hold major positions as Spirit Manipulators

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.560
They're with the Duanmus for centuries

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:13.620
How can the relationship of 2 families

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:15.120
compare to a mere Soul Image?

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:15.830
You

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:17.240
Enough!

00:09:17.492 --> 00:09:20.133
Situ Li was the first who attacked my Soul Image

00:09:20.133 --> 00:09:22.069
then proceeded to injure me

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:25.100
His sinful misconducts have caused grave implications

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:26.630
and it is unforgivable

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.520
Your lack of discipline

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:29.970
is a great offense

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:33.085
I beg Master to show mercy

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.700
Both of you are expelled from Duanmu's household

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:36.600
But...

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.460
I've made up my mind

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:40.300
Say no more

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:45.900
When I think about it

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:50.400
Duanmu should have the ability to escape Situ Li's dagger attack

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:54.060
but why he abruptly let him stabbed into his palm?

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.120
Could he be

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:59.160
finding an excuse so I can be spared?

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:01.160
I gotta say

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.940
I'm involved in this issue

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:05.020
I don't know why after grabbing the sword,

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:06.800
my whole being suddenly changed

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:07.580
Did you know

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:08.720
how awesome I was?

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:09.880
In one swing,

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:12.100
the sword struck on that little Situ...

00:10:12.106 --> 00:10:13.857
If I see you touch that sword again

00:10:13.857 --> 00:10:15.073
I'll chop off your hand

00:10:15.073 --> 00:10:16.935
Left hand touches, off with the left

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:18.880
Right hand touches, off with the right

00:10:18.947 --> 00:10:20.792
What if I touch with both hands?

00:10:20.792 --> 00:10:22.152
Stop yakking. Get it?!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.220
I got it

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.930
Why the short fuse?

00:10:25.937 --> 00:10:27.917
I was forced in helpless situation

00:10:27.917 --> 00:10:28.869
That moment

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:30.180
I almost got dissipated

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:31.300
What?

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:33.240
You got dissipated?

00:10:33.756 --> 00:10:35.991
I-I'm alright now

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:38.100
That's enough

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:40.900
Stop touching me so much

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.300
Even a guy would fall for you if you keep touching

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:44.180
You fool

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:47.160
You can't fight him, why didn't you run?

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.820
Where the f*ck do I run?

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.600
You put so much restriction on me

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.940
How was I supposed to run?

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:55.440
Fine if you don't care but it gets on my nerve

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.930
Who told you to go out?

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:58.060
Couldn't you run to me?

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.360
I couldn't make it!

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:00.780
Then why didn't you call me?

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:02.460
Didn't I taught you telepathy?

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:03.590
Why didn't you use it?

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:04.300
Pig head!

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.200
I called

00:11:05.201 --> 00:11:06.062
but did you hear?!

00:11:06.062 --> 00:11:07.873
You were sleeping like a dead pig!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.340
You really called me?

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:15.220
Yea...

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.480
Next time

00:11:16.489 --> 00:11:18.551
I'll listen

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.230
Sure sure

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:22.840
Please remove my boundary restriction

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.220
I'll manage it myself

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:25.640
Don't be foolhardy

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:27.220
If you're in trouble,

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.600
call me

00:11:28.895 --> 00:11:30.428
Do you understand?

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:32.590
This is an order

00:11:32.989 --> 00:11:35.396
Don't make me say it twice

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.060
It's the first time

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:53.030
I feel that I don't really understand Duanmu Xi at all

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:06.810
Looking at the stars

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:13.080
Traveling through the sky with the cold moon

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:17.410
Speak softly of

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:24.530
the unspeakable yearnings

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:28.170
Let the memories

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:34.830
gets frozen as poems in the long night

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:39.140
Let everything

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:45.720
sunk faintly into silence

00:12:56.280 --> 00:13:00.350
while still carry

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:06.600
the longing for the light

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:21.340
is hope

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:27.410
is metamorphosis
